This repository is a derivative work of the EBA Fraud Taxonomy, Version 7.0
(3 June 2026), which is © Euro Banking Association (EBA) 2026 and licensed by
the Euro Banking Association under CC BY 4.0. The taxonomy content in
taxonomy.json is attributed to the Euro Banking Association.

The additional material in this repository (JSON structure, identifier codes,
lineage records, schema.json, scripts and documentation) is voluntary work by
users of the taxonomy, prepared for the Euro Banking Association, and is
likewise made available under CC BY 4.0, attributed to its contributors.

Changes made to the source material are described in README.md under
"Changes made". Individual definitions quoted by the EBA from third-party
sources remain the property of their respective authors and are cited in
taxonomy.json with source and source_url.

You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose, including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit, provide a link to the
licence, and indicate if changes were made.

